function holdoutAuditPanel(snapshot,eligible){queueMicrotask(refreshReservations);queueMicrotask(refreshLegacyOrigins);queueMicrotask(refreshDeclarationWriteJournal);queueMicrotask(refreshHoldoutWriteJournal);queueMicrotask(refreshFixedEvaluationWriteJournal);return `<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>核对并固定排除范围</h2><p>检查本机记录，可将未发现使用的奖期固定为探索任务排除范围。</p></div></div><div id="holdout-write-journal" class="panel-body" hidden aria-live="polite"></div><div id="fixed-evaluation-write-journal" class="panel-body" hidden aria-live="polite"></div><form id="holdout-audit-form" class="panel-body"><div class="field"><label for="holdout-snapshot">历史快照</label><select id="holdout-snapshot" name="snapshot" required>${backend.snapshots.map(x=>`<option value="${escape(x.id)}">${escape(x.first_issue)}—${escape(x.last_issue)} / ${escape(x.id.slice(0,8))}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="holdout-start">范围起始奖期</label><input id="holdout-start" name="start" value="${escape(eligible[Math.max(0,eligible.length-10)]||snapshot.first_issue)}" pattern="[0-9]{5}" required></div><div class="field"><label for="holdout-end">范围结束奖期</label><input id="holdout-end" name="end" value="${escape(eligible[eligible.length-1]||snapshot.last_issue)}" pattern="[0-9]{5}" required></div></div><p class="section-subtext">检查已记录的训练、方案生成、回测和纸面结果。失败或中断的任务也会列出，表示可能接触过数据。</p><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="submit" class="button">核对本机使用记录</button></div><div id="holdout-audit-result" class="section-space" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></form><div class="panel-body"><h3>旧自定义奖金来源</h3><p class="section-subtext">来源只能由本人补充声明，不能证明数据独立；多次声明均保留，曾声明参考的历史期不会被后续声明抹除。</p><div id="origin-write-journal" hidden aria-live="polite"></div><div id="legacy-origin-list" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div id="holdout-reservations" class="panel-body" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="fixed-eval-editor" class="panel-body"></div></section>`;}
function holdoutAuditContent(a){const kinds={training_task:'训练任务',model_artifact:'模型产物',candidate_generation:'方案生成',backtest_task:'回测任务',backtest_report:'回测报告',paper_result:'纸面结果',exploration_activity:'计算使用记录',portfolio_scenario_evaluation:'历史奖金情景评估',portfolio_scenario_unverified:'本人声明或未核验的奖金期号',custom_scenario_origin:'自定义奖金来源未声明'},states={running:'运行中',complete:'已完成',finished:'已结束',failed:'已失败',cancelled:'已取消',saved:'已保存',user_declared:'本人声明'};const title={known_use:'发现相关本机记录',no_recorded_use:'未发现已记录的使用',unresolved:'有记录无法核对'}[a.status]||'核对不完整';const when=new Date(a.as_of_utc).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',hour12:false});const findings=a.findings.map(x=>`<tr><td>${escape(kinds[x.kind]||'研究记录')}<small>${escape(states[x.status]||x.status)} / ${escape(x.record_key.slice(0,24))}</small></td><td>${escape(x.input_issues.join('、')||'—')}</td><td>${escape(x.target_issues.join('、')||'—')}</td></tr>`).join('');const unresolved=a.unresolved.map(x=>`<li>${escape(kinds[x.kind]||'研究记录')} ${escape(x.record_key.slice(0,24))}：${x.kind==='custom_scenario_origin'?'旧自定义奖金未留存来源，无法判断是否涉及本范围；可在下方旧记录补录本人声明。':'记录或关联历史无法核对'}</li>`).join('');return `<div class="notice amber"><strong>${escape(title)}</strong><p>检查范围 ${escape(a.issues[0])}—${escape(a.issues[a.issues.length-1])}，共 ${a.issues.length} 期；独立性仍未验证。</p><p>记录为失败、取消或运行中的任务只说明可能接触过数据，不能断言其完成。未发现记录也不能证明本人或其他工具没有看过这些结果。</p></div>${findings?`<p class="table-scroll-hint">可左右滑动查看输入期与目标期</p><div class="table-wrap section-space" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="本机使用记录，可横向滚动"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>记录</th><th>范围内涉及的历史输入</th><th>范围内涉及的目标期或奖金情景期</th></tr></thead><tbody>${findings}</tbody></table></div>`:'<p class="section-subtext section-space">没有匹配的可核对记录。</p>'}${unresolved?`<div class="notice amber section-space"><strong>以下记录无法核对</strong><ul>${unresolved}</ul></div>`:''}<p class="section-subtext">核对时点：${escape(when)}（北京时间）。本次核对不会固定范围，也不生成采用结论。</p>`;}
async function submitHoldoutAudit(form){const f=new FormData(form),signature=JSON.stringify([f.get('snapshot'),f.get('start'),f.get('end')]),button=form.querySelector('[type=submit]'),sequence=++holdoutAuditSequence,root=el('holdout-audit-result');button.disabled=true;root.innerHTML='<p class="section-subtext">正在核对本机记录…</p>';try{const data=await backendPost('/api/holdout-audit',{snapshot_id:String(f.get('snapshot')),start_issue:String(f.get('start')),end_issue:String(f.get('end'))});if(form.isConnected&&sequence===holdoutAuditSequence){const current=new FormData(form),unchanged=signature===JSON.stringify([current.get('snapshot'),current.get('start'),current.get('end')]);if(!unchanged){root.innerHTML='<div class="notice amber">核对已完成，但表单参数在请求期间发生变化；结果未应用，请按当前参数重新核对。</div>';return;}delete form.dataset.dirty;root.innerHTML=holdoutAuditContent(data.audit);if(data.audit.status==='no_recorded_use')root.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<label class="checkbox-row section-space"><input type="checkbox" name="reserve-confirm"><span>我理解固定后不能修改或取消；本人及外部工具可能已看过结果，独立性尚未验证。</span></label><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="button" class="button primary" data-action="reserve-holdout">固定为探索排除范围</button></div><div id="holdout-reserve-error" class="error-text" role="alert"></div>`);}}catch(e){if(form.isConnected&&sequence===holdoutAuditSequence)root.innerHTML=`<div class="notice amber">核对未完成：${escape(e.message)}</div>`;}finally{if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=false;}}
let holdoutReservations=[],fixedEvaluations=[];
function exactYuan(f){if(!Array.isArray(f)||f.length!==2)return '暂无';try{let n=BigInt(f[0]),d=BigInt(f[1]);if(d<=0n)return '暂无';let negative=n<0n;if(negative)n=-n;let cents=(n*100n*2n+d)/(2n*d);return `${negative&&cents!==0n?'-':''}${cents/100n}.${String(cents%100n).padStart(2,'0')} 元`;}catch{return '暂无';}}
function fixedEvaluationReport(e){if(e.status!=='complete'||!e.report)return '';const content=e.report.methods.map(item=>{const r=item.result,periods=r.periods.map(p=>{const reason=p.replicas.filter(x=>x.status!=='complete').map(x=>`${x.replica}：${x.reason||'未完成'}`).join('；');return `<tr><td>${escape(p.target.issue)}</td><td>${p.status==='complete'?'完整':`未完成<small>${escape(reason)}</small>`}</td><td>${escape(exactYuan(p.mean_difference_fraction))}</td></tr>`;}).join(''),replicas=r.periods.flatMap(p=>p.replicas.map(x=>{const amounts=z=>z?`${z.gross} / ${z.tax} / ${z.cost} / ${z.net}`:'—';return `<tr><td>${escape(p.target.issue)} / ${escape(x.replica)}</td><td>${escape(amounts(x.candidate_settlement))}</td><td>${escape(amounts(x.control_settlement))}</td><td>${escape(x.difference_yuan??'暂无')}</td></tr>`;})).join('');return `<div class="section-space"><strong>${escape(generationMethods[item.result.protocol.candidate.method]||item.id)}</strong><p class="section-subtext">完整 ${r.complete_periods} / ${r.planned_periods} 期 · ${r.completeness==='complete'?'完整结果':'部分结果'} · 期均配对差额 ${escape(exactYuan(r.descriptive_mean_fraction))}</p>${e.validity==='local_descriptive'?pairedDescription(e.paired_descriptions?.[item.id]):''}<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>奖期</th><th>状态</th><th>税后净收益配对差额</th></tr></thead><tbody>${periods}</tbody></table></div><details class="section-space"><summary>查看每个副本的成本与收益</summary><p class="section-subtext">各列金额顺序：税前奖金 / 税费 / 成本 / 净收益，单位：元。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>奖期 / 副本</th><th>候选</th><th>随机对照</th><th>净收益差额</th></tr></thead><tbody>${replicas}</tbody></table></div></details></div>`;}).join('');const correctionNote=e.correction?`<div class="notice section-space"><strong>已更正金额</strong><p>沿用原号码包和固定情景核算，未重新训练。原报告摘要 ${escape(e.correction.base_report_sha256.slice(0,12))}；更正后摘要 ${escape(e.correction.report_sha256.slice(0,12))}。</p>${e.original_report?`<details><summary class="text-button">查看更正前的报告</summary>${fixedEvaluationReport({...e,report:e.original_report,original_report:null,correction:null,validity:'review_required',validity_reason:'更正前的历史结果',can_recalculate_amounts:false})}</details>`:''}</div>`:'';return e.validity==='review_required'?`<div class="notice amber">结果或依赖需要复核，以下为历史结果，不作为当前有效结果。${e.validity_reason?'原因：'+escape(e.validity_reason):''}${e.can_recalculate_amounts?`<div class="actions section-space"><button type="button" class="button" data-action="recalculate-fixed-amounts" data-reservation="${escape(e.reservation_id)}">按原号码重算金额</button></div><p>不重新训练或选择方法；原报告会保留。</p>`:''}</div><details><summary>查看历史结果</summary>${content}</details>`:`${correctionNote}<p class="section-subtext">以下为固定方法后的历史描述结果；来源、时点和独立性均未独立验证；不提供跨期推断区间，也不自动给出采用结论。</p>${content}`;}
function reservationCards(){return holdoutReservations.length?holdoutReservations.map(r=>{const e=fixedEvaluations.find(x=>x.reservation_id===r.id),originBlocked=!!r.custom_origin_exposure?.length||!!e?.custom_origin_exposure?.length,labels={pending:'协议已固定',running:'评估运行中',complete:'评估已完成',failed:'评估失败'},attemptLabels={running:'运行中',complete:'已完成',failed:'失败'};return `<div class="section-space"><div class="section-label"><strong>${escape(r.content.start_issue)}—${escape(r.content.end_issue)} 期</strong>${tag(r.superseded_by?'已由新版本替代':e?labels[e.status]||'状态待核对':'尚未固定评估协议',e?.status==='complete'&&e.validity==='local_descriptive'?'green':'amber')}</div><p class="section-subtext">${r.content.issues.length} 个奖期 · 独立性未验证${r.content.supersedes?' · 新版本，继承 '+escape(r.content.supersedes.slice(0,8)):''}</p>${originBlocked?'<div class="notice amber">旧自定义奖金来源未明或本人声明涉及本范围，固定评估需要复核。</div>':''}${r.content.supersession_reason?`<p class="section-subtext">创建原因：${escape(r.content.supersession_reason)}</p>`:''}${!e?`<button type="button" class="button" data-action="configure-fixed-eval" data-reservation="${escape(r.id)}" ${originBlocked?'disabled':''}>配置固定评估</button>`:`<p class="section-subtext">假设：${escape(e.protocol.hypothesis)} · 方法：${e.protocol.methods.map(x=>escape(generationMethods[x.protocol.candidate.method]||x.id)).join('、')}</p><details><summary class="text-button">查看已固定协议</summary><pre class="draw-raw">${escape(JSON.stringify(e.protocol,null,2))}</pre></details>${e.status==='pending'?(originBlocked?'<p class="section-subtext">来源需要复核，暂不能运行。</p>':e.superseded_by?`<p class="section-subtext">旧协议已由 ${escape(e.superseded_by.slice(0,8))} 替代，保留供审计，不能运行。</p>`:e.environment_matches===false?(e.can_supersede?`<div class="notice amber">执行代码或环境已变化，原协议不能在当前环境启动。旧协议尚未运行，可经本人确认、重新核对本机使用后创建关联版本。</div><button type="button" class="button section-space" data-action="prepare-eval-successor" data-reservation="${escape(r.id)}">创建关联新版本</button>`:`<div class="notice amber">执行环境变化且记录状态无法满足新版本条件，请先核对运行记录。</div>`):`<button type="button" class="button primary" data-action="start-fixed-eval" data-reservation="${escape(r.id)}" data-retry="false">运行固定评估</button><p class="section-subtext">失败可按原协议显式重试；每次运行均保留记录。</p>`):''}${e.status==='running'?'<p class="section-subtext">正在按固定协议运行，完成后显示报告。</p>':''}${e.status==='failed'?`<div class="notice amber">${escape(e.error||'评估未完成')}；原协议和失败状态已保留。</div>${!originBlocked&&e.attempts.length<10?`<button type="button" class="button section-space" data-action="start-fixed-eval" data-reservation="${escape(r.id)}" data-retry="true">按原协议重试</button>`:(originBlocked?'<p class="section-subtext">来源需要复核，暂不能重试。</p>':'<p class="section-subtext">重试次数已达上限。</p>')}`:''}${e.attempts?.length?`<details class="section-space"><summary>查看运行记录</summary>${e.attempts.map(a=>`<p class="section-subtext">第 ${a.attempt_no+1} 次 · ${escape(attemptLabels[a.status]||a.status)}${a.retry_of?' · 关联上次运行':''}${a.error?' · '+escape(a.error):''}</p>`).join('')}</details>`:''}${fixedEvaluationReport(e)}`}</div>`;}).join(''):'<p class="section-subtext">暂无固定范围。</p>';}
async function refreshReservations(force=false){if(reservationTask){const prior=await reservationTask;if(!force)return prior;return refreshReservations();}const task=loadReservations();reservationTask=task;try{return await task;}finally{if(reservationTask===task)reservationTask=null;}}
async function loadReservations(){const root=el('holdout-reservations');if(!root)return true;const connection=connectionEpoch;try{const [response,evalResponse]=await Promise.all(['/api/holdout-reservations','/api/fixed-evaluations'].map(url=>fetch(url,{credentials:'same-origin'})));if(!response.ok||!evalResponse.ok)throw new Error('读取失败');const data=await response.json(),evaluations=await evalResponse.json();if(!root.isConnected||state.page!=='backtest'||connection!==connectionEpoch)return false;const changed=JSON.stringify(data.reservations)!==JSON.stringify(holdoutReservations)||JSON.stringify(evaluations.evaluations)!==JSON.stringify(fixedEvaluations);holdoutReservations=data.reservations;fixedEvaluations=evaluations.evaluations;if(changed||!root.innerHTML)root.innerHTML=`<h3>已固定的探索排除范围</h3>${reservationCards()}<p class="section-subtext">固定评估每个范围只允许一份协议；完成后不能换方法或重跑，失败只能沿原协议重试。本机研究入口会排除这些奖期，但本人和外部工具仍可能看到结果，故这不是独立保留集认证。</p>` ;return true;}catch(e){if(root.isConnected&&state.page==='backtest'&&connection===connectionEpoch)root.innerHTML='<p class="error-text">已固定范围读取失败，请稍后重试。</p>';return false;}}
function configureFixedEvaluation(id){const r=holdoutReservations.find(x=>x.id===id),root=el('fixed-eval-editor'),limits=backend.backtestLimits;if(!r||!root||r.superseded_by||r.content.supersedes)return;if(!limits){root.innerHTML='<div class="notice amber">回测限额尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务后重试。</div>';return;}const modelValidationPeriods=Math.min(5,limits.max_model_validation_periods);root.innerHTML=`<div class="notice section-space"><strong>固定评估协议</strong><p>范围 ${escape(r.content.start_issue)}—${escape(r.content.end_issue)} 期。请一次选定全部要比较的方法；固定后不能替换或增加，执行失败也不能另选协议。</p></div><form id="fixed-eval-form" data-reservation="${escape(id)}" class="section-space"><div class="field"><label>研究假设<input name="hypothesis" maxlength="1000" required placeholder="例如：热号与冷号相比随机对照的税后净收益差异"></label></div><fieldset class="field"><legend>预先固定方法</legend>${[['random','均匀随机'],['hot','热号加权'],['cold','冷号加权'],['tree','树模型'],['lstm','LSTM']].map(([key,label])=>`<label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="method" value="${key}" ${key==='hot'?'checked':''}><span>${label}</span></label>`).join('')}</fieldset><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label>每包预算（元）<input name="budget" type="number" min="${limits.budget_fen[0]/100}" max="${limits.budget_fen[1]/100}" value="36" required></label></div><div class="field"><label>每期副本数<input name="replicas" type="number" min="1" max="${limits.max_replicas}" value="2" required></label></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label>历史窗口（期）<input name="history" type="number" min="${limits.min_history_periods}" max="${limits.max_history_periods}" value="60" required></label></div><div class="field"><label>随机种子<input name="seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" value="20261029" required></label></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label>投注方式<select name="additional"><option value="no">普通单式</option><option value="yes">追加单式</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>总运行时限（秒）<input name="timeout" type="number" min="${limits.timeout_seconds[0]}" max="${limits.timeout_seconds[1]}" value="${limits.timeout_seconds[1]}" required></label></div></div><p class="section-subtext">统一单式结构及成本；主要指标为税后净收益配对差额，先按副本算术平均再按完整奖期平均，缺失期不计零。树模型：窗口 6、验证 ${modelValidationPeriods} 期、深度 2、最小叶节点 2；LSTM：窗口 6、验证 ${modelValidationPeriods} 期、隐层 3、1 轮、学习率 0.1。各方法总奖期与副本组合最多 ${limits.max_target_replica_pairs}。</p><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" required><span>我确认方法、范围和参数；理解固定后不能更换，结果仅作历史描述，独立性未验证。</span></label><div id="fixed-eval-error" class="error-text" role="alert"></div><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="button" class="button" data-action="cancel-fixed-eval">取消</button><button type="submit" class="button primary">固定评估协议</button></div></form>`;root.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'smooth'});}
async function submitFixedEvaluation(form){const f=new FormData(form),signature=JSON.stringify([...f.entries()]),r=holdoutReservations.find(x=>x.id===form.dataset.reservation),error=el('fixed-eval-error'),selected=f.getAll('method').map(String),submit=form.querySelector('[type=submit]'),limits=backend.backtestLimits;if(!limits){error.textContent='回测限额尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务后重试。';return;}if(!r||!selected.length){error.textContent='至少选择一种方法。';return;}if(selected.some(x=>['tree','lstm'].includes(x))&&!backend.trainingVersions){error.textContent='算法版本尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务。';return;}const replicas=Number(f.get('replicas')),history=Number(f.get('history')),seed=Number(f.get('seed')),budget=Number(f.get('budget')),additional=f.get('additional')==='yes';if(replicas<1||replicas>limits.max_replicas||history<limits.min_history_periods||history>limits.max_history_periods||budget*100<limits.budget_fen[0]||budget*100>limits.budget_fen[1]||Number(f.get('timeout'))<limits.timeout_seconds[0]||Number(f.get('timeout'))>limits.timeout_seconds[1]||r.content.issues.length>limits.max_targets||r.content.issues.length*replicas*selected.length>limits.max_target_replica_pairs){error.textContent='全部方法的奖期与副本组合超过当前限额 '+limits.max_target_replica_pairs+'。';return;}const methods=selected.map(method=>{const candidate={method,structure:'singles',rule_version:'local-2026-historical-assumptions-v1',calendar_version:'historical-reconstruction',budget_fen:budget*100,base_price_fen:200,additional_price_fen:300,additional,window:Math.min(60,history),front_count:6,back_count:3,max_tickets:limits.max_tickets,max_sampling_attempts:limits.max_sampling_attempts,score_temperature:1};return {id:method,protocol:{mode:'historical_reconstruction',analysis:'descriptive',aggregation:'arithmetic_mean_v1',selection_role:'exploration',snapshot_id:r.content.snapshot_id,targets:r.content.issues,replicas:Array.from({length:replicas},(_,i)=>'replica-'+(i+1)),seed,history_periods:history,limits:{max_targets:limits.max_targets,max_replicas:limits.max_replicas,max_history:limits.max_history_periods},candidate,model:{window:6,validation_periods:Math.min(5,limits.max_model_validation_periods),...(['tree','lstm'].includes(method)?{algorithm_version:backend.trainingVersions.algorithm[method],feature_schema_version:backend.trainingVersions.feature_schema,preprocessing_version:backend.trainingVersions.preprocessing[method]}:{}),parameters:method==='lstm'?{hidden_size:3,epochs:1,learning_rate:0.1}:{max_depth:2,min_leaf:2}}}};});submit.disabled=true;try{const entry=await runFixedEvaluationWrite('freeze',{reservation_id:r.id,methods,hypothesis:String(f.get('hypothesis')).trim(),timeout:Number(f.get('timeout')),confirmed:f.get('confirm')==='on'},'评估协议已固定。');if(entry.phase==='accepted'){if(JSON.stringify([...new FormData(form).entries()])===signature)form.remove();else error.textContent='原提交的评估协议已固定；提交期间修改的输入已保留在此表单，尚未提交。';}}catch(e){if(form.isConnected)error.textContent=e.message;}finally{if(submit.isConnected)submit.disabled=false;}}
function prepareEvaluationSuccessor(id){const e=fixedEvaluations.find(x=>x.reservation_id===id),root=el('fixed-eval-editor');if(!e?.can_supersede||!root)return;root.innerHTML=`<div class="notice amber section-space"><strong>创建关联新版本</strong><p>旧协议 ${escape(id.slice(0,8))} 保留；新版本原样继承方法、预算、种子、奖期、奖金情景及假设，仅更新执行环境。系统会重新核对本机记录及奖金情景；旧协议被替代后不能运行。本人或外部工具可能已看到开奖结果，独立性仍未验证。</p></div><form id="supersede-fixed-eval-form" data-reservation="${escape(id)}" class="section-space"><details><summary class="text-button">查看旧协议的完整配置</summary><pre class="draw-raw">${escape(JSON.stringify(e.protocol,null,2))}</pre></details><div class="field"><label>创建原因<input name="reason" maxlength="1000" required placeholder="例如：系统升级，需要在新环境重新固定协议"></label></div><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" required><span>我确认旧协议从未运行，同意保留原选择并在新环境创建关联版本</span></label><div id="supersede-fixed-eval-error" class="error-text" role="alert"></div><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="button" class="button" data-action="cancel-fixed-eval">取消</button><button type="submit" class="button primary">确认创建新版本</button></div></form>`;root.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'smooth'});}
async function submitEvaluationSuccessor(form){const f=new FormData(form),signature=JSON.stringify([...f.entries()]),button=form.querySelector('[type=submit]');button.disabled=true;try{const entry=await runFixedEvaluationWrite('supersede',{reservation_id:form.dataset.reservation,reason:String(f.get('reason')).trim(),confirmed:f.get('confirm')==='on'},'关联版本已创建并保留原协议，请查看后运行。');if(entry.phase==='accepted'&&form.isConnected){if(JSON.stringify([...new FormData(form).entries()])===signature)el('fixed-eval-editor').innerHTML='';else{const error=form.querySelector('#supersede-fixed-eval-error');if(error)error.textContent='原提交的关联版本已创建；提交期间修改的输入已保留在此表单，尚未提交。';}}}catch(e){if(form.isConnected){const error=form.querySelector('#supersede-fixed-eval-error');if(error)error.textContent=e.message;else toast('创建未完成：'+e.message);}}finally{if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=false;}}
async function startFixedEvaluation(button){button.disabled=true;try{await runFixedEvaluationWrite('start',{reservation_id:button.dataset.reservation,retry:button.dataset.retry==='true'},'固定评估请求已受理。');}catch(e){toast('固定评估请求未完成：'+e.message);}finally{if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=false;}}
async function recalculateFixedAmounts(button){button.disabled=true;try{await runFixedEvaluationWrite('recalculate_amounts',{reservation_id:button.dataset.reservation},'金额已按原号码重算，原报告已保留。');}catch(e){toast('金额重算未完成：'+e.message);}finally{if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=false;}}
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-action="recalculate-fixed-amounts"]');if(button&&!button.disabled)recalculateFixedAmounts(button);});
async function reserveHoldout(button){const form=button.closest('form'),error=el('holdout-reserve-error');if(!form.elements['reserve-confirm']?.checked){error.textContent='请先确认固定后的限制。';return;}const f=new FormData(form);button.disabled=true;try{const entry=await getHoldoutWriteJournal().begin({snapshot_id:String(f.get('snapshot')),start_issue:String(f.get('start')),end_issue:String(f.get('end'))});if(entry.phase==='accepted'){if(form.isConnected)el('holdout-audit-result').innerHTML='<div class="notice">探索排除范围已固定。后续启用独立评估仍需单独验证。</div>';await refreshReservations();}else if(error.isConnected)error.textContent=entry.phase==='fenced'?'原请求已封止，可在上方选择关联重试。':'请求结果待确认，请在上方查询原请求。';await refreshHoldoutWriteJournal();}catch(e){if(error.isConnected)error.textContent=e.message;await refreshHoldoutWriteJournal();}finally{if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=false;}}
function realBacktest(){
  const s=backend.snapshots[0],limits=backend.backtestLimits;
  if(!limits)return heading('历史回测','回测限额尚未核验。')+'<section class="panel"><div class="notice amber">回测限额尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务后重试。</div></section>';
  if(!s)return heading('历史回测','按历史开奖顺序重建候选与随机对照。')+`<section id="task-write-journal" class="panel section-space" aria-live="polite" hidden></section><section id="real-backtest" class="panel"><div class="empty-state"><h3>尚无历史快照</h3><p>先载入本地研究快照，再配置回测。</p>${button('载入本地历史快照','import-snapshot','primary')}</div></section>`;
  const eligible=s.issues.filter(x=>x>='26014'&&x<='26123'),modelValidationPeriods=Math.min(5,limits.max_model_validation_periods);
  return heading('历史回测','按历史开奖顺序逐期重建候选与同成本随机对照。')+`<section id="task-write-journal" class="panel section-space" aria-live="polite" hidden></section><div id="real-backtest" class="two-column"><div class="stack"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>配置历史回测</h2><p>历史重建 · 描述性研究</p></div>${tag('未验证独立证据','amber')}</div><form id="real-backtest-form" class="panel-body">
  <div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-snapshot">历史快照</label><select id="run-bt-snapshot" name="snapshot">${backend.snapshots.map(x=>`<option value="${escape(x.id)}">${escape(x.first_issue)}—${escape(x.last_issue)} / ${x.id.slice(0,8)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-method">候选方法</label><select id="run-bt-method" name="method"><option value="hot">热号加权</option><option value="cold">冷号加权</option><option value="random">均匀随机</option><option value="tree">树模型</option><option value="lstm">LSTM</option></select></div></div>
  <div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-start">起始奖期</label><input id="run-bt-start" name="start" value="${escape(eligible[Math.max(0,eligible.length-5)]||'')}" pattern="[0-9]{5}" required></div><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-end">结束奖期</label><input id="run-bt-end" name="end" value="${escape(eligible[eligible.length-1]||'')}" pattern="[0-9]{5}" required></div></div>
  <div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-history">每期历史窗口</label><input id="run-bt-history" name="history" type="number" min="${limits.min_history_periods}" max="${limits.max_history_periods}" value="60" required></div><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-replicas">每期配对副本</label><input id="run-bt-replicas" name="replicas" type="number" min="1" max="${limits.max_replicas}" value="3" required></div></div>
  <div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-budget">每包预算（元）</label><input id="run-bt-budget" name="budget" type="number" min="${limits.budget_fen[0]/100}" max="${limits.budget_fen[1]/100}" step="1" value="36" required></div><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-seed">随机种子</label><input id="run-bt-seed" name="seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" value="20261029" required></div></div>
  <div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-timeout">运行时间上限（秒）</label><input id="run-bt-timeout" name="timeout" type="number" min="${limits.timeout_seconds[0]}" max="${limits.timeout_seconds[1]}" value="120" required></div><div class="field"><label for="run-bt-additional">投注方式</label><select id="run-bt-additional" name="additional"><option value="no">普通单式</option><option value="yes">追加单式</option></select></div></div>
  <p class="section-subtext">固定模型协议：6 期特征窗口、${modelValidationPeriods} 期验证；树模型深度 2、最小叶节点 2；LSTM 隐层 3、训练 1 轮、学习率 0.1。模型在每个目标期分别重训。每期最多 ${limits.max_tickets} 注，最多 ${limits.max_targets} 期且总配对次数不超过 ${limits.max_target_replica_pairs}。</p><div id="run-bt-error" class="error-text" role="alert"></div><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="submit" class="button primary">${icon('play')}开始回测</button></div></form></section>
  ${holdoutAuditPanel(s,eligible)}<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>回测任务与报告</h2><p>每个目标期为一个开奖样本，副本不是独立开奖。</p></div></div><div id="backtest-jobs" aria-live="polite">${backtestJobs()}</div></section></div><aside class="stack"><section class="notice amber">按本地历史快照事后重建，无法证明历史数据在当时可用；来源和税费口径未经独立核验。结果只作描述，不构成方法有效或盈利的证据。</section><section class="notice">使用留存的各期基本奖金及完整配对假设，假设无其他同期开奖中奖收入；不重算新增中奖者的分奖或限额。26050—26066 期仅在派奖标记、单票分组及全部派奖金额字段通过校验时计算，否则保留为未完成。</section></aside></div>`;
}
function backtestResult(r,description){if(!r||typeof r!=='object')return '<p class="section-subtext">历史报告结构无法读取。</p>';const periods=Array.isArray(r.periods)?r.periods:[],missing=Array.isArray(r.incomplete_issues)?r.incomplete_issues.length:'未知',amounts=z=>z&&typeof z==='object'?`${z.gross??'缺失'}${z.promotion_bonus!==undefined?`（含派奖 ${z.promotion_bonus}；达标模拟票 ${z.promotion_qualified_ticket_groups??'未知'} 张）`:''} / ${z.tax??'缺失'} / ${z.cost??'缺失'} / ${z.net??'缺失'}`:'金额缺失';return `<p class="section-subtext">计划 ${escape(r.planned_periods??'未知')} 期，完整 ${escape(r.complete_periods??'未知')} 期，未完成 ${escape(missing)} 期；完整奖期的平均税后净收益配对差额 ${escape(rationalYuan(r.descriptive_mean_fraction))}。未完成奖期不参与均值，不能据此判断方法优劣。</p>${pairedDescription(description)}<details><summary class="text-button">查看逐期记录与失败原因</summary><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>奖期</th><th>状态</th><th>平均配对差额</th><th>副本明细</th></tr></thead><tbody>${periods.map(period=>`<tr><td>${escape(period?.target?.issue??'未知')}</td><td>${period?.status==='complete'?'完整':'未完成或待复核'}</td><td>${escape(rationalYuan(period?.mean_difference_fraction))}</td><td>${Array.isArray(period?.replicas)?period.replicas.map(rep=>rep?.status==='complete'?`${escape(rep.replica??'未知')}：候选 ${escape(amounts(rep.candidate_settlement))} 元；对照 ${escape(amounts(rep.control_settlement))} 元；配对差 ${escape(rep.difference_yuan??'缺失')} 元`:`${escape(rep?.replica??'未知')}：${escape(rep?.reason||'未完成')}`).join('<br>'):'副本明细缺失'}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="section-subtext">金额顺序为总奖金、税费、成本、净收益；括号中的派奖金额为总奖金组成部分。完整输入和报告摘要保存在本机；候选与对照每包分别计税。</p></details>`;}
function backtestJobs(){
  if(!backend.backtests.length)return '<div class="panel-body"><p class="section-subtext">还没有回测任务。</p></div>';
  const labels={running:'运行中',complete:'已完成',failed:'失败',cancelled:'已取消'};
  return `<div class="panel-body">${backend.backtests.slice(0,10).map(j=>{const p=j.request.protocol,r=j.result?.report,review=j.result?.status==='review_required';return `<div class="section-space"><div class="section-label"><div><h3>${escape(generationMethods[p.candidate.method]||p.candidate.method)} · ${escape(p.targets[0])}—${escape(p.targets[p.targets.length-1])}</h3><p class="section-subtext">${p.replicas.length} 个配对副本 / 每包预算 ${(p.candidate.budget_fen/100).toFixed(2)} 元 / ${escape(j.created_at)}${j.request.retry_of?` / 关联重试自 ${escape(j.request.retry_of)}`:``}</p></div>${tag(review?'结果待复核':r?.completeness==='partial'?'部分完成':labels[j.status]||j.status,review||r?.completeness==='partial'?'amber':j.status==='complete'?'green':'blue')}</div>
  ${j.status==='running'?`<p class="section-subtext">正在逐期计算，完成后保存全部记录。</p><button class="button" data-action="cancel-backtest" data-job="${escape(j.request_key)}">取消任务</button>`:''}${j.status==='failed'?`<p class="section-subtext">${escape(j.error||'任务失败')}</p>`:''}${j.status==='cancelled'?'<p class="section-subtext">任务已取消，没有发布报告。</p>':''}${['failed','cancelled'].includes(j.status)?`<button class="button" data-action="retry-backtest" data-job="${escape(j.request_key)}">按原配置关联重试</button>`:''}
  ${r?(review?`<div class="notice amber">结果或依赖待复核，当前统计不可用；历史报告保留供追溯。${j.result?.reason?'原因：'+escape(j.result.reason):''}</div><details class="section-space"><summary class="text-button">查看历史报告</summary>${backtestResult(r,null)}</details>`:backtestResult(r,j.result?.paired_description)):''}</div>`;}).join('')}</div>`;
}
async function submitBacktest(form){
  const limits=backend.backtestLimits;if(!limits){el('run-bt-error').textContent='回测限额尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务后重试。';return;}
  const f=new FormData(form),signature=JSON.stringify([...f.entries()]),s=backend.snapshots.find(x=>x.id===f.get('snapshot')),start=String(f.get('start')),end=String(f.get('end'));
  const startAt=s?.issues.indexOf(start)??-1,endAt=s?.issues.indexOf(end)??-1,replicas=Number(f.get('replicas')),history=Number(f.get('history')),seed=Number(f.get('seed')),budget=Number(f.get('budget')),additional=f.get('additional')==='yes',method=String(f.get('method'));
  if(!s||startAt<0||endAt<startAt||start<'26014'||end>'26123'||endAt-startAt+1>limits.max_targets||replicas<1||replicas>limits.max_replicas||(endAt-startAt+1)*replicas>limits.max_target_replica_pairs||history<limits.min_history_periods||history>limits.max_history_periods||budget*100<limits.budget_fen[0]||budget*100>limits.budget_fen[1]||Number(f.get('timeout'))<limits.timeout_seconds[0]||Number(f.get('timeout'))>limits.timeout_seconds[1]){el('run-bt-error').textContent='范围需存在于快照的 26014—26123 期，并符合当前奖期、副本、历史窗口、预算、时限与组合限额。';return;}
  const targets=s.issues.slice(startAt,endAt+1);if(targets.length!==Number(end)-Number(start)+1){el('run-bt-error').textContent='所选范围内有缺失奖期，请先核对数据；不能跳过缺失期运行。';return;}
  const candidate={method,structure:'singles',rule_version:'local-2026-historical-assumptions-v1',calendar_version:'historical-reconstruction',budget_fen:budget*100,base_price_fen:200,additional_price_fen:300,additional,window:Math.min(60,history),front_count:6,back_count:3,max_tickets:limits.max_tickets,max_sampling_attempts:limits.max_sampling_attempts,score_temperature:1};
  if(['tree','lstm'].includes(method)&&!backend.trainingVersions){el('run-bt-error').textContent='算法版本尚未核验，请重新连接本机服务。';return;}
  const protocol={mode:'historical_reconstruction',analysis:'descriptive',aggregation:'arithmetic_mean_v1',selection_role:'exploration',snapshot_id:s.id,targets,replicas:Array.from({length:replicas},(_,i)=>'replica-'+(i+1)),seed,history_periods:history,limits:{max_targets:limits.max_targets,max_replicas:limits.max_replicas,max_history:limits.max_history_periods},candidate,model:{window:6,validation_periods:Math.min(5,limits.max_model_validation_periods),...(['tree','lstm'].includes(method)?{algorithm_version:backend.trainingVersions.algorithm[method],feature_schema_version:backend.trainingVersions.feature_schema,preprocessing_version:backend.trainingVersions.preprocessing[method]}:{}),parameters:method==='lstm'?{hidden_size:3,epochs:1,learning_rate:0.1}:{max_depth:2,min_leaf:2}}};
  const submit=form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');submit.disabled=true;el('run-bt-error').textContent='';
  try{const result=await getTaskWriteJournal().begin('backtest',{protocol,timeout:Number(f.get('timeout'))});if(result.phase!=='accepted')throw new Error('回测请求已保存在本机，结果待确认；请在页面上方查询或继续原请求。');if(form.isConnected&&JSON.stringify([...new FormData(form).entries()])===signature)delete form.dataset.dirty;await refreshBackend();toast('历史回测任务已提交或已从原请求恢复。');}catch(e){if(form.isConnected)el('run-bt-error').textContent=e.message;await refreshTaskWriteJournal();}finally{submit.disabled=false;}
}
async function cancelBacktest(key){try{const result=await getTaskWriteJournal().begin('backtest_cancel',{target_request_key:key});await refreshBackend();await refreshTaskWriteJournal();toast(result.phase==='accepted'?'取消请求已记录，任务状态已重新读取。':'取消请求结果待确认，请在页面上方核对。');}catch(e){await refreshTaskWriteJournal();toast('取消请求结果待确认：'+e.message);}}

function backtest(){if(backend.ready)return realBacktest();if(D.historical_hidden_due_to_reservation)return heading('历史回测','历史结果用于探索；未来观察单独记录。',button('检查本机状态','sync','primary','refresh'))+`<div class="notice amber section-space">本机排除范围与既有静态探索汇总的奖期有交集。该汇总不能按奖期重新计算，暂不显示；请通过本机服务查看范围核对后的记录。</div>`;return heading('历史回测','历史结果用于探索；未来观察单独记录。',button('配置回测','backtest-config','primary','play'))+`<section id="task-write-journal" class="panel section-space" aria-live="polite" hidden></section><section id="backtest-editor" class="panel backtest-editor" aria-labelledby="backtest-editor-heading" hidden></section>
<div class="notice section-space" style="margin:0 0 20px">以下来自已有研究：2026 年 106 个常规奖期，每期 36 元，每种方法 500 个副本。副本共用实际开奖路径。</div><div class="two-column"><div class="stack"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>已完成的历史探索</h2><p>按实际奖金和当期税费口径结算</p></div>${tag('历史探索','amber')}</div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>方法</th><th class="align-right">ROI 中位数</th><th class="align-right">5%—95% 分位</th><th>证据状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['random18','随机 18 注'],['hot60_18','热号加权 18 注'],['cold60_18','冷号加权 18 注'],['compound_6_3','频率加权复式'],['dantuo_4_6_3','频率加权胆拖'],['random12_additional','随机 12 注追加']].map(([key,name])=>{let r=D.historical[key];return `<tr><td>${name}</td><td class="align-right negative">${pct(r.median_roi)}</td><td class="align-right">${pct(r.roi_p05_p95[0])} 至 ${pct(r.roi_p05_p95[1])}</td><td>${tag('尚无稳定优势')}</td></tr>`;}).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="table-note">分位数描述同一历史上选号波动，不是未来收益置信区间。17 个特别派奖奖期已单列。</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>回测边界自检</h2>${tag('可交互校验','blue')}</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="cutoff-check">模型训练截止期</label><input id="cutoff-check" value="26123" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="5"></div><div class="field"><label for="target-check">预测目标期</label><input id="target-check" value="26124" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="5"></div></div><div id="leak-result" class="notice">时间边界通过：训练截止期早于目标期。</div><p class="section-subtext">训练截止期必须早于预测目标期，预处理状态与模型权重需分别核验。</p></div></section></div><aside class="stack"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>对照检查</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><dl class="definition-list"><div><dt>预算</dt><dd>同为 36 元</dd></div><div><dt>统计量</dt><dd>按整期收益比较</dd></div><div><dt>复式与胆拖</dt><dd>另有同结构随机对照</dd></div><div><dt>目标期数据</dt><dd>不得进入训练</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="notice amber">新建模型需完成独立回测，才能纳入历史结果比较。</section></aside></div>`;}

